          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"contract_version\":\"results-document-v2\",\"selection\":{\"journey_ids\":[],\"benchmark_observation_id\":\"C1\",\"incomplete_observation_ids\":[\"A3\",\"A110\"]},\"blocks\":[{\"kind\":\"narrative\",\"text\":\"I don’t have a complete award itinerary to recommend for SFO–Bangkok in January 2027. The award findings are route-level summaries rather than assembled trips with full schedules, so they can be useful leads, but they don’t establish a workable itinerary.\" ,\"reference_kind\":null,\"reference_id\":null,\"label\":null,\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"narrative\",\"text\":\"One lead matches your requested route and January window: an Alaska economy award summary for January 1 quotes 42,500 miles plus USD 50.90 in taxes and fees. That gives you a starting point to investigate, not a flight you can plan around yet—the summary has no departure or arrival times, duration, or stop information. Its price scope is unknown, so the quoted amount cannot be assumed to cover you or a party; the one-traveler search echo does not establish per-person pricing.\",\"reference_kind\":null,\"reference_id\":null,\"label\":null,\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"text\":\"A route-matching award lead, but not a complete schedule.\",\"reference_kind\":\"lead\",\"reference_id\":\"A3\",\"label\":\"January 1 SFO–Bangkok award lead\",\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"narrative\",\"text\":\"If a business-cabin segment is more important than keeping the trip entirely on the requested route, there is also a TPE–Bangkok business award summary for December 31 at 30,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 75.30 in taxes and fees. It departs from Taipei a day before your January window, so it would require separate positioning from San Francisco to Taipei; the positioning and onward connection are not established as one protected trip. Its schedule and price scope are also unknown, so this is a research lead rather than a bookable through-itinerary.\",\"reference_kind\":null,\"reference_id\":null,\"label\":null,\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"text\":\"A business-cabin lead from Taipei, on December 31—not a complete SFO–Bangkok option.\",\"reference_kind\":\"lead\",\"reference_id\":\"A110\",\"label\":\"December 31 Taipei–Bangkok business lead\",\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"narrative\",\"text\":\"For a cash baseline on the requested route, the January 1 search returned a USD 640 itinerary from SFO to BKK. It takes 44 hours 40 minutes and arrives in Bangkok on January 4, so the lower cash quote comes with a long journey. The returned search was for one traveler, but the price scope is unknown and should not be read as a confirmed per-person or party total.\",\"reference_kind\":null,\"reference_id\":null,\"label\":null,\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"reference\",\"text\":\"An end-to-end cash comparison for SFO–Bangkok; its reported itinerary is lengthy and its price scope is unknown.\",\"reference_kind\":\"benchmark\",\"reference_id\":\"C1\",\"label\":\"Cash baseline — SFO to Bangkok\",\"claims\":[]},{\"kind\":\"narrative\",\"text\":\"These are dated observations from October 9, 2026, not live availability. The award-detail search for the requested route was not completed, and the searches involving Taipei were partial. Neither the award summaries nor their seat figures confirm that the itinerary can be assembled, that a connection is protected, or that seats and quoted prices remain available. The quoted award and cash price scopes remain unknown; that uncertainty is separate from the requested traveler count of one.\",\"reference_kind\":null,\"reference_id\":null,\"label\":null,\"claims\":[]}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
          "logprobs": []
        }
